{"id":"n28558-1-8","stage":3,"title":"냉방 · 制冷","scene":"情境对话","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n28558-1-8-1","ko":"더운데 어디 카페라도 들어갈까?","zh":"这么热，咱们进去哪家咖啡馆坐坐吧？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"더운데","meaning":"热，暑","explanation":"덥다：热，暑；은데：先交代背景，再引出后文的转折、补充、请求或问题。","readings":[{"term":"덥다","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"44484","senseId":"1","lemma":"덥다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"더운데","audio":"/audio/6a4a31748d07da622588.mp3"}},{"text":"어디","meaning":"哪里，哪儿","explanation":"어디：哪里，哪儿","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"3","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}},{"text":"카페라도","meaning":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","explanation":"카페：咖啡店，咖啡馆；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；라도：表示让步或假定：“即使是、就算是”。","readings":[{"term":"카페","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"72162","senseId":"1","lemma":"카페","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"카페라도","audio":"/audio/e47131affafc577b2a9b.mp3"}},{"text":"들어갈까?","meaning":"进，进去","explanation":"들어가다：进，进去；ㄹ까：非敬语地提出建议、自问或推测：“要不要、会不会”。","readings":[{"term":"들어가다","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"67877","senseId":"1","lemma":"들어가다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"들어갈까","audio":"/audio/b7c93b32422c217c474c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"038a0682ef015c0a","term":"덥다","zh":"热，暑","audio":"/audio/038a0682ef015c0a8e45.mp3","entryId":"44484","definition":"体感气温高。","pronunciation":["덥ː따"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"哪里，哪儿","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代不确定的或难以准确表述的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"53cc9fb21b3694bf","term":"카페","zh":"咖啡店，咖啡馆","audio":"/audio/53cc9fb21b3694bf4cb3.mp3","entryId":"72162","definition":"主要销售咖啡、茶、点心等的店铺。","pronunciation":[]},{"id":"5a3b0d8b05ae781d","term":"들어가다","zh":"进，进去","audio":"/audio/5a3b0d8b05ae781d7f0f.mp3","entryId":"67877","definition":"由外往里去。","pronunciation":["드러가다"]}],"audio":"/audio/2ce94301ec57b8417d16.mp3","speakerIndex":0},{"id":"n28558-1-8-2","ko":"시원하게 냉방만 잘되면 어디든 상관없어요.","zh":"只要空调够凉快，去哪儿都无所谓。","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"시원하게","meaning":"凉爽，凉快","explanation":"시원하다：凉爽，凉快；게：使前面的动作或状态修饰后文，也用于 -게 되다、-게 하다 等搭配。","readings":[{"term":"시원하다","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"71281","senseId":"1","lemma":"시원하다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"시원하게","audio":"/audio/112eefb30d9512024e22.mp3"}},{"text":"냉방만","meaning":"制冷","explanation":"냉방：制冷；만：表示“只、仅”。","readings":[{"term":"냉방","audio":"/audio/7f4e19fd8863ab0083c7.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"28558","senseId":"1","lemma":"냉방","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냉방만","audio":"/audio/a3c7240b762fe8a40ae4.mp3"}},{"text":"잘되면","meaning":"顺利，好","explanation":"잘되다：顺利，好；면：表示条件或假设：“如果、若、……的话”。","readings":[{"term":"잘되다","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"62302","senseId":"4","lemma":"잘되다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"잘되면","audio":"/audio/cd343227420333d13f41.mp3"}},{"text":"어디든","meaning":"一个地方","explanation":"어디：一个地方；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；든：表示选择；与疑问词合用时可表示“无论、任何”。","readings":[{"term":"어디","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"60319","senseId":"2","lemma":"어디","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"어디든","audio":"/audio/2ac5b0942b74f5a92a65.mp3"}},{"text":"상관없어요.","meaning":"可以，没关系","explanation":"상관없다：可以，没关系；어요：礼貌句末；可随语调表示陈述或询问。","readings":[{"term":"상관없다","audio":"/audio/9524cdb146f9f56f250c.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"16206","senseId":"2","lemma":"상관없다","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"상관없어요","audio":"/audio/a3dfaef618b13526a825.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"a1a23b7fbec5dd69","term":"시원하다","zh":"凉爽，凉快","audio":"/audio/a1a23b7fbec5dd69c7b5.mp3","entryId":"71281","definition":"不冷不热，适当清凉。","pronunciation":["시원하다"]},{"id":"7f4e19fd8863ab00","term":"냉방","zh":"制冷","audio":"/audio/7f4e19fd8863ab0083c7.mp3","entryId":"28558","definition":"用机器降低室内温度。","pronunciation":["냉ː방"]},{"id":"2bf32329a9311a6d","term":"잘되다","zh":"顺利，好","audio":"/audio/2bf32329a9311a6d9b04.mp3","entryId":"62302","definition":"事情朝着理想的方向发展。","pronunciation":["잘되다","잘뒈다"]},{"id":"c1ee1b7e560f9f3a","term":"어디","zh":"一个地方","audio":"/audio/c1ee1b7e560f9f3ac3bf.mp3","entryId":"60319","definition":"指代没有向听话人表明的某个处所。","pronunciation":["어디"]},{"id":"9524cdb146f9f56f","term":"상관없다","zh":"可以，没关系","audio":"/audio/9524cdb146f9f56f250c.mp3","entryId":"16206","definition":"不成特别的问题或没有可以担心的，不要紧。","pronunciation":["상과넙따"]}],"audio":"/audio/2034f980ae1a84c911bf.mp3","speakerIndex":1}],"difficulty":2.716,"source":{"url":"https://krdict.korean.go.kr/chn/dicSearch/SearchView?ParaWordNo=28558","label":"国立国语院韩国语—汉语学习词典","license":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/2.0/kr/"},"sourceSenseId":"1","sourceLevel":"중급","day":94,"sequenceScore":2.5427,"questions":[{"lineIndex":0,"options":["只要空调够凉快，去哪儿都无所谓。","这么热，咱们进去哪家咖啡馆坐坐吧？","上周你不是说有人给你介绍对象了吗？后来怎么样了？"],"answer":1},{"lineIndex":1,"options":["这么热，咱们进去哪家咖啡馆坐坐吧？","上周你不是说有人给你介绍对象了吗？后来怎么样了？","只要空调够凉快，去哪儿都无所谓。"],"answer":2}]}
